575 0 obj
<<
/Title (The Fair Split Bill system addresses the inherent inequities of traditional bill-splitting by replacing arbitrary division with a precise, data-driven algorithm. By leveraging the robust capabilities of C++, developed a high-performance, offline-capable solution that meticulously calculates individual consumption, accurately apportions shared items, and distributes taxes proportionally. Ultimately, this project not only demonstrates the practical application of object-oriented programming and reliable file handling, but it also delivers a highly equitable tool that definitively resolves the everyday financial friction of shared dining expenses.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 675 0 R
/Next 435 0 R
>>
endobj
